WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.210
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:06.480 --> 00:08.200
[The content, events, techniques, and outcomes of massage depicted in this series]

3
00:08.210 --> 00:09.411
[are entirely fictional and intended for entertainment purposes only.]

4
00:09.420 --> 00:11.000
[They should not be used as medical advice or as a reference for traditional Thai massage.]

5
00:11.040 --> 00:12.141
[Viewer discretion is advised. Do not attempt to imitate any of the techniques shown,]

6
00:12.150 --> 00:13.151
[as doing so may result in injury.]

7
00:13.160 --> 00:14.161
[Massage services should only be provided by practitioners]

8
00:14.170 --> 00:15.171
[who are legally licensed and registered.]

9
00:16.942 --> 00:20.560
Ittha, Pingkhala, Sumana,

10
00:20.864 --> 00:22.160
Kalathari,

11
00:22.427 --> 00:24.240
Sahatsarangsi,

12
00:24.880 --> 00:25.881
Thawari,

13
00:26.400 --> 00:27.760
Chanthaphusang,

14
00:28.300 --> 00:29.301
Rucham,

15
00:29.680 --> 00:30.920
Sukhumang, and

16
00:31.360 --> 00:32.600
Sikhini.

17
00:34.220 --> 00:37.360
Massage—an ancient practice passed down through generations.

18
00:37.502 --> 00:39.760
The art of healing

19
00:39.896 --> 00:41.440
through precise touch.

20
00:41.800 --> 00:43.560
Whether squeezing,

21
00:44.014 --> 00:45.015
pressing,

22
00:45.360 --> 00:46.361
pulling,

23
00:46.454 --> 00:47.455
stretching,

24
00:47.960 --> 00:48.961
or kneading.

25
00:50.080 --> 00:52.640
But when two best friends

26
00:52.744 --> 00:54.640
succumb to the darkness within

27
00:54.920 --> 00:58.600
and discover a forbidden art never known before,

28
00:59.096 --> 01:00.920
the power to heal is transformed

29
01:01.011 --> 01:03.012
into a weapon of revenge.

30
01:04.046 --> 01:07.160
The line between saving a life and taking one

31
01:07.470 --> 01:09.520
can be crossed with a mere turn of the hand.

32
01:12.667 --> 01:14.200
Therapeutic touch

33
01:14.374 --> 01:17.760
becomes a way to kill with bare hands, leaving no trace,

34
01:18.000 --> 01:20.990
before the victim even realizes what is happening.

35
01:23.582 --> 01:25.600
When the dark art of deadly massage...

36
01:26.067 --> 01:29.920
an undiscovered forbidden practice is used as a weapon,

37
01:30.512 --> 01:33.800
it turns a healer into a murderer.

38
01:34.840 --> 01:37.720
The only way to stop it is to...

39
01:38.220 --> 01:39.321
destroy it.

40
01:44.400 --> 01:45.600
[DO NOT READ]

41
02:50.560 --> 02:52.920
[PHUKET, 2011]

42
02:59.472 --> 03:00.473
Ease in.

43
03:01.600 --> 03:02.601
Apply pressure.

44
03:03.947 --> 03:04.948
Hold.

45
03:09.848 --> 03:10.984
The Ten Principal Sen Lines—

46
03:11.592 --> 03:13.640
the body’s primary energy pathways.

47
03:14.600 --> 03:17.320
Ittha runs along the left.

48
03:17.696 --> 03:20.600
Pingkhala runs along the right.

49
03:21.632 --> 03:24.640
The areas that must never be massaged are extremely important.

50
03:25.248 --> 03:26.880
Commit them to memory.

51
03:27.650 --> 03:28.651
The temples.

52
03:29.120 --> 03:30.121
The neck.

53
03:30.960 --> 03:31.961
The armpits.

54
03:33.947 --> 03:37.640
Coordinate your breathing with the pressure you apply

55
03:38.136 --> 03:40.400
to control how long each press is held.

56
03:40.899 --> 03:43.800
Pressure duration is divided into short and long cycles.

57
03:44.800 --> 03:47.960
A short cycle lasts 10 to 15 seconds.

58
03:49.566 --> 03:50.720
12…

59
03:51.288 --> 03:52.560
13…

60
03:53.200 --> 03:54.201
14…

61
03:54.835 --> 03:56.000
15…

62
04:00.334 --> 04:01.840
Awesome!

63
04:04.499 --> 04:05.500
Wow!

64
04:18.019 --> 04:19.020
All done, sir.

65
04:30.275 --> 04:31.276
Thank you.

66
04:32.654 --> 04:33.655
Thank you, sir.

67
04:35.518 --> 04:36.960
Would you like to work for me?

68
04:39.382 --> 04:40.383
What do you say?

69
04:41.296 --> 04:43.440
You’d supervise hundreds of massage therapists.

70
04:44.358 --> 04:45.359
Interested?

71
04:48.603 --> 04:51.280
Thank you, but as it happens,

72
04:53.158 --> 04:54.680
I’ve just opened a place of my own.

73
04:56.182 --> 04:57.183
Here’s my business card.

74
05:02.672 --> 05:04.560
The beach there is very peaceful.

75
05:05.259 --> 05:07.260
Please come and visit sometime.

76
05:08.640 --> 05:09.760
I’ll take my leave now. Goodbye.

77
05:10.123 --> 05:11.124
Goodbye.

78
05:16.624 --> 05:17.920
He dared to turn you down.

79
05:21.328 --> 05:22.600
Should we kill the bastard?

80
05:24.918 --> 05:25.919
Hey!

81
05:26.520 --> 05:28.621
I’m not opening a massage parlor.

82
05:38.680 --> 05:40.720
Please go here, my dad is the best.

83
05:40.899 --> 05:42.360
Oh, your shop?

84
05:42.723 --> 05:44.000
Our family's shop.

85
05:44.248 --> 05:45.249
Wow.

86
05:46.686 --> 05:47.880
Thank you so much.

87
05:48.120 --> 05:49.280
Thank you.

88
05:49.427 --> 05:50.428
Thank you.

89
05:51.416 --> 05:53.320
- Bye. - Bye.

90
06:10.968 --> 06:13.400
Hey, did you see my money? It blew over this way.

91
06:17.144 --> 06:18.800
Have you seen it?

92
06:20.336 --> 06:22.840
- Did you see my money? - No.

93
06:25.728 --> 06:28.704
Are you crying? What’s wrong? Are you sick?

94
06:28.811 --> 06:30.846
I have a headache. Leave me alone.

95
06:41.891 --> 06:42.892
What are you doing?

96
06:42.915 --> 06:45.200
Stay still. Massaging this spot will make it go away.

97
07:21.100 --> 07:22.160
Does that feel better?

98
07:26.254 --> 07:28.080
This is my dad’s shop. You can stop by sometime.

99
07:43.862 --> 07:45.691
Patrick. Patrick, come on.

100
07:45.760 --> 07:47.200
Let's go to see your father.

101
07:47.261 --> 07:49.100
I have something to talk to him. Hurry up.

102
08:17.326 --> 08:18.327
All done.

103
08:23.230 --> 08:24.440
So you’ve opened your new shop.

104
08:24.491 --> 08:26.920
Does that mean you won’t come to my house to massage me anymore?

105
08:28.304 --> 08:29.720
I still can.

106
08:31.403 --> 08:33.680
But I’d rather you come to my shop.

107
08:33.840 --> 08:36.280
The atmosphere there is wonderful.

108
08:36.816 --> 08:38.600
You’ll feel much more relaxed.

109
08:38.843 --> 08:39.844
All right.

110
08:40.219 --> 08:41.240
Congratulations.

111
08:41.880 --> 08:42.881
Thank you.

112
08:56.891 --> 08:58.360
Let’s go, sis!

113
08:58.656 --> 09:01.168
Did you get into the wrong one? I’m your mother.

114
09:04.288 --> 09:05.889
- Should we go? - Let's go.

115
09:11.763 --> 09:13.200
Mom! That's Dad!

116
09:13.800 --> 09:15.301
- Dad! - Korn.

117
09:25.251 --> 09:26.360
I’m off, then.

118
09:36.880 --> 09:38.560
- Does it smell good? - It does.

119
09:57.819 --> 09:59.040
Phak’s here.

120
10:01.128 --> 10:02.920
- Why don't you go and see him, sweetheart? - Phak!

121
10:04.974 --> 10:05.975
Where have you been?

122
10:08.286 --> 10:09.287
Oh, my brilliant engineer!

123
10:10.710 --> 10:13.240
Phak!

124
10:13.344 --> 10:15.915
I thought you said things were hectic at the construction site. How did you get here?

125
10:15.979 --> 10:17.020
I slipped away for a bit, Mom.

126
10:17.099 --> 10:19.600
They’re definitely going to dock your pay.

127
10:20.979 --> 10:22.720
Minkheng, come help me.

128
10:22.856 --> 10:23.857
Sure.

129
10:24.680 --> 10:27.720
Here. Pick whichever color you like.

130
10:27.770 --> 10:28.880
Everyone, take one bowl.

131
10:29.566 --> 10:30.567
What are you doing, son?

132
10:30.606 --> 10:33.200
- Just take one and follow me. - What? All right, take one.

133
10:33.260 --> 10:34.261
Just play along with him.

134
10:34.456 --> 10:35.457
Follow me.

135
10:39.331 --> 10:41.960
Dad, you go first.

136
10:42.590 --> 10:44.899
Me? What am I supposed to do?

137
10:45.144 --> 10:48.960
Put your palm print on this sign to mark it as yours.

138
11:11.078 --> 11:12.360
That looks beautiful.

139
11:14.080 --> 11:16.040
Hattha has the tiniest handprint of all.

140
11:24.107 --> 11:26.040
May we all be blessed with good health,

141
11:26.060 --> 11:28.120
may our business prosper.

142
11:28.342 --> 11:29.480
And may everyone be happy.

143
11:31.043 --> 11:32.044
Sathu.

144
11:46.371 --> 11:48.000
Mom and I embroidered it together.

145
11:50.880 --> 11:53.350
- We kept it a secret. - You never told me about this.

146
11:53.400 --> 11:54.616
How could it be a surprise if we told you?

147
11:56.563 --> 11:59.000
It belongs to all of us, just like you always say.

148
12:00.339 --> 12:02.734
- Thank you. - You two finally did it.

149
12:03.432 --> 12:04.560
Thank you both so much.

150
12:05.760 --> 12:06.761
And thank you too.

151
12:07.761 --> 12:08.762
Thank you too.

152
12:18.414 --> 12:19.415
What?

153
12:19.955 --> 12:20.956
When?

154
12:21.208 --> 12:22.209
I’m coming right now.

155
12:22.856 --> 12:24.960
Dad, I need to go to the construction site.

156
12:26.467 --> 12:27.468
Is something wrong, son?

157
12:28.302 --> 12:29.600
The building at the construction site collapsed.

158
12:29.704 --> 12:30.920
Was anyone hurt?

159
12:31.086 --> 12:32.640
I don’t know yet. I have to go.

160
12:43.363 --> 12:45.920
At present, unauthorized personnel are strictly prohibited

161
12:45.964 --> 12:47.520
from entering the area.

162
12:47.540 --> 12:49.260
If another incident occurs,

163
12:49.290 --> 12:50.680
the situation could become even more complicated.

164
12:51.270 --> 12:52.960
We have instructed

165
12:53.083 --> 12:55.880
the forensic team to collect as much evidence as possible.

166
12:56.502 --> 12:58.560
The cause of the collapse remains unknown.

167
12:58.667 --> 13:01.300
Meanwhile, the engineer responsible for the design and construction supervision

168
13:01.360 --> 13:03.040
has not yet provided any information.

169
13:03.142 --> 13:06.566
We will report further details as soon as they become available.

170
13:09.936 --> 13:11.300
Is that Phak?

171
13:14.980 --> 13:15.981
Go!

172
13:17.291 --> 13:19.560
What the hell are you going to do? I told you to admit you were at fault.

173
13:19.729 --> 13:22.000
I already told you, I did nothing wrong. I’m not going, no matter what.

174
13:25.686 --> 13:26.687
Give it to me.

175
13:31.950 --> 13:33.880
Pha, I need to go see our son.

176
13:37.902 --> 13:39.003
I'm coming with you.

177
13:39.459 --> 13:40.460
Don't go!

178
13:48.771 --> 13:49.772
Hattha!

179
14:00.120 --> 14:01.121
Dad!

180
14:07.600 --> 14:08.960
Hey, come here!

181
14:18.544 --> 14:20.200
Hattha, go back inside.

182
14:20.720 --> 14:22.400
No! I need to see Phak.

183
14:25.566 --> 14:26.567
Fine, let's go.

184
14:33.379 --> 14:34.720
It's your customer's house.

185
14:46.939 --> 14:47.940
Hey!

186
14:51.467 --> 14:52.468
Come here.

187
14:53.568 --> 14:54.569
Hattha.

188
14:55.334 --> 14:57.648
- Wait here, I will be right back. - Dad.

189
14:57.660 --> 15:00.200
Listen to me, okay? Wait for me here.

190
15:28.739 --> 15:30.520
Sign the admission of liability and get this over with.

191
15:31.480 --> 15:32.481
I won’t sign it.

192
15:33.184 --> 15:34.680
You’re the ones who should be held responsible.

193
15:34.806 --> 15:36.170
I warned you about the steel.

194
15:36.459 --> 15:39.320
You knew about it, but you did nothing.

195
15:39.595 --> 15:41.850
I told you to fix the problem.

196
15:41.880 --> 15:43.520
And you promised you would.

197
15:43.808 --> 15:47.400
You were more afraid the project would be shut down and you’d lose your job.

198
15:47.744 --> 15:49.045
You piece of shit. Sign it!

199
15:49.360 --> 15:51.464
- Sign it! - No!

200
16:01.022 --> 16:02.520
What are you doing?

201
16:03.318 --> 16:04.240
Okay, okay.

202
16:04.470 --> 16:05.720
Turn around and get up slowly.

203
16:06.326 --> 16:07.327
Hurry up!

204
16:08.203 --> 16:09.204
Give me the phone.

205
16:09.638 --> 16:11.360
- I just took pictures of the house. It's pretty. - Hurry!

206
16:12.235 --> 16:15.280
[WARNING: The massage techniques depicted in this series are fictional. Do not attempt to imitate them.]

207
16:22.422 --> 16:24.480
Hattha, press the line on his neck.

208
16:24.550 --> 16:25.920
That’s a forbidden massage point, Dad.

209
16:26.000 --> 16:28.240
Hurry up. Press it now!

210
16:29.411 --> 16:30.840
Use two fingers. Two fingers.

211
16:32.958 --> 16:34.080
Good. That’s it, son.

212
16:35.040 --> 16:36.041
Almost there.

213
16:44.000 --> 16:45.001
Is he dead, Dad?

214
16:45.334 --> 16:46.520
No. He’ll wake up soon.

215
16:46.715 --> 16:47.760
He’s only unconscious. Go, son.

216
16:49.387 --> 16:50.640
Hey!

217
16:51.718 --> 16:53.800
That’s enough! He’s going to die!

218
16:58.203 --> 16:59.840
You should’ve signed it from the start, you idiot.

219
17:00.299 --> 17:01.360
Let go of my son right now!

220
17:06.331 --> 17:08.100
Don’t shoot! He’ll shoot me!

221
17:11.835 --> 17:13.800
Hattha, take pictures of them.

222
17:14.256 --> 17:15.257
You need to record everything.

223
17:20.253 --> 17:21.760
Go! Hurry!

224
17:22.733 --> 17:25.400
Don’t follow us, or I’ll really shoot him!

225
17:30.760 --> 17:32.400
- Let's go. - Shit!

226
17:43.355 --> 17:44.356
Dad, stop here.

227
17:45.910 --> 17:46.911
Why's that?

228
17:49.760 --> 17:51.000
I have evidence about the building collapse.

229
17:51.115 --> 17:53.360
Dad, pick up Mom and meet me at the police station.

230
17:54.470 --> 17:55.471
Wait.

231
17:58.123 --> 17:59.124
Take this gun with you.

232
18:03.024 --> 18:04.025
Be careful.

233
18:04.944 --> 18:05.945
See you there.

234
18:19.782 --> 18:22.183
You damn masseur. I’m coming for you.

235
18:28.806 --> 18:31.640
You were more afraid the project would be shut down and you’d lose your job.

236
18:32.003 --> 18:33.160
- Bastard! - Oh my son!

237
18:37.582 --> 18:39.083
- Oh no! - That guy's Dongyang.

238
18:39.416 --> 18:41.040
The one whose face we couldn’t see was his guy.

239
18:41.500 --> 18:42.501
He was flat-footed.

240
18:42.880 --> 18:44.680
What does flat-footed mean, Dad?

241
18:45.000 --> 18:46.050
The arches of his feet were flat, honey.

242
19:15.075 --> 19:16.076
We have to hurry.

243
19:16.320 --> 19:17.976
Go! Hurry, son!

244
19:22.670 --> 19:25.240
- Mom! Mom! - Pha!

245
19:25.822 --> 19:26.823
Mom!

246
19:27.390 --> 19:28.391
Pha!

247
19:29.363 --> 19:31.350
Hey, the gun will be too loud.

248
19:33.310 --> 19:34.720
Go, honey. Take your mother and run.

249
19:53.494 --> 19:55.880
Planning to use that video against me, you damn masseur?

250
19:57.040 --> 19:58.441
Kill them all.

251
19:58.971 --> 20:00.480
Hattha, take your mother and run!

252
20:07.179 --> 20:08.180
Mom!

253
20:11.723 --> 20:13.160
- Get down here. - Hattha.

254
20:13.216 --> 20:14.217
No!

255
20:20.310 --> 20:21.311
Mom!

256
20:25.120 --> 20:28.240
[WARNING: The massage techniques depicted in this series are fictional. Do not attempt to imitate them.]

257
20:38.136 --> 20:40.080
Hattha, press the point beneath his armpit.

258
20:40.520 --> 20:43.521
[WARNING: The massage techniques depicted in this series are fictional. Do not attempt to imitate them.]

259
20:49.790 --> 20:50.800
Korn!

260
20:51.048 --> 20:52.049
Korn!

261
20:54.720 --> 20:56.000
Hey, let go!

262
20:56.440 --> 20:57.441
Mom!

263
21:08.182 --> 21:09.183
Burn this place.

264
21:09.446 --> 21:11.840
Burn him alive. Let him guard this damn shop.

265
21:15.280 --> 21:16.400
Burn everything down.

266
21:32.728 --> 21:33.850
Grab him!

267
22:12.926 --> 22:13.927
You bastards!

268
22:16.088 --> 22:17.200
That’s a woman and a girl!

269
22:17.779 --> 22:19.566
Come at me instead! Come on!

270
22:20.366 --> 22:21.400
Damn it!

271
22:28.499 --> 22:29.960
Mom! Mom!

272
22:35.344 --> 22:36.345
Our shop...

273
22:39.675 --> 22:40.676
Dad!

274
22:51.814 --> 22:52.815
Hattha!

275
22:53.318 --> 22:55.040
Run! Run, son!

276
22:56.592 --> 22:58.320
- Go! - No, mom! No!

277
22:59.171 --> 23:01.120
I can't take it anymore. I really can't.

278
23:01.619 --> 23:04.560
- I don't think I can make it. - Mom! Come with me.

279
23:05.480 --> 23:06.481
I can’t go on.

280
23:07.104 --> 23:08.105
I can’t do it.

281
23:08.304 --> 23:09.440
Go, honey. Go!

282
23:10.011 --> 23:12.012
Mom, this way!

283
23:34.864 --> 23:35.865
This way, Mom!

284
23:40.630 --> 23:42.000
I’ll catch up with you.

285
23:53.366 --> 23:54.960
Mom, come down!

286
24:01.840 --> 24:02.841
Mom!

287
24:05.870 --> 24:08.280
Mom! Mom!

288
24:13.272 --> 24:14.320
Don’t make a sound.

289
24:14.952 --> 24:16.440
Once they’re gone,

290
24:16.611 --> 24:18.400
I’ll move this rock off you.

291
24:19.112 --> 24:20.200
Do my hands smell nice?

292
24:20.640 --> 24:22.300
It’s the scent of the herbs you love.

293
24:25.339 --> 24:27.200
Hold my hand. Don’t cry.

294
24:28.544 --> 24:29.545
Mom!

295
24:29.808 --> 24:30.809
Mom!

296
24:34.971 --> 24:36.160
Mom!

297
24:45.971 --> 24:46.972
Flatfoot!

298
24:54.883 --> 24:56.100
You’re the flat-footed one!

299
24:57.491 --> 24:58.600
Mom!

300
25:00.536 --> 25:02.835
Mom! Mom!

301
25:16.920 --> 25:17.955
Back off, you bastard!

302
25:19.480 --> 25:20.481
Where the hell did he go?

303
25:47.520 --> 25:48.840
Aim at him, you idiot!

304
26:04.710 --> 26:05.711
Guys!

305
26:32.099 --> 26:33.100
Asshole!

306
26:33.742 --> 26:37.040
How dare you mess with me?

307
26:42.342 --> 26:44.720
Mom! Mom!

308
27:13.624 --> 27:14.800
What are you doing?

309
27:15.624 --> 27:16.625
Hey!

310
27:17.518 --> 27:19.600
Hey, what is going on?

311
27:33.435 --> 27:34.560
I'm not scared.

312
27:35.436 --> 27:36.960
You're here with me.

313
27:39.843 --> 27:41.440
- Does it smell good? - Yeah.

314
27:47.400 --> 27:50.080
Mommy’s hands smell nice. I’m not scared.

315
28:23.550 --> 28:25.200
This beach smells fishy, Dad.

316
28:26.680 --> 28:29.320
You really do have a good nose. I can’t smell anything.

317
28:32.030 --> 28:34.960
Uncle Korn’s shop is so far away. Who would come all the way out here, Dad?

318
28:40.355 --> 28:41.356
Hey!

319
28:43.336 --> 28:44.337
Oh, no!

320
29:04.283 --> 29:05.284
Korn!

321
29:05.387 --> 29:06.520
- Korn! - Hattha!

322
29:07.990 --> 29:09.600
- Hattha! - Pha!

323
29:15.448 --> 29:17.560
Dad, I can smell blood that way.

324
29:21.614 --> 29:22.615
Son?

325
29:23.075 --> 29:24.600
Are you sure you can smell blood?

326
29:27.902 --> 29:28.903
Yes.

327
29:39.283 --> 29:40.284
It really is blood.

328
29:50.408 --> 29:52.100
- Dad! - Be careful, son.

329
29:53.912 --> 29:55.813
Get behind me and be careful.

330
30:02.899 --> 30:03.900
Pha.

331
30:06.760 --> 30:07.761
Pha.

332
30:08.192 --> 30:09.760
Help!

333
30:10.363 --> 30:11.364
Help!

334
30:14.144 --> 30:16.760
Help me! Help!

335
30:19.518 --> 30:20.519
What?

336
30:21.828 --> 30:22.829
Help!

337
30:22.880 --> 30:23.881
Hattha?

338
30:24.574 --> 30:26.480
- Uncle Inn, please help me. - Hattha.

339
30:26.840 --> 30:27.841
Hold on, sweetheart.

340
30:31.766 --> 30:32.800
Watch out.

341
30:35.766 --> 30:36.767
Come here.

342
30:37.750 --> 30:38.751
Get up here.

343
30:39.987 --> 30:40.988
Mom!

344
30:41.536 --> 30:42.537
Mom!

345
30:44.816 --> 30:45.817
Mom!

346
30:46.582 --> 30:47.583
Mom!

347
31:02.590 --> 31:06.680
The body of the design engineer was found hanging in his room.

348
31:06.808 --> 31:10.220
He left a letter confessing that his design error caused the building to collapse.

349
31:10.558 --> 31:11.760
He’s here!

350
31:16.759 --> 31:20.560
Sir, does this mean the building-collapse case can now be closed?

351
31:21.915 --> 31:23.739
Under criminal law,

352
31:23.776 --> 31:27.080
when the offender dies, the criminal case is considered closed.

353
31:28.224 --> 31:30.480
However, I won’t rush to any conclusions.

354
31:30.528 --> 31:33.200
We must also be fair to the deceased.

355
31:33.542 --> 31:37.100
There are still several pieces of evidence that must be examined together,

356
31:37.446 --> 31:41.480
particularly whether the handwriting in the letter belongs to the deceased.

357
31:42.819 --> 31:44.680
Please excuse me for a moment.

358
31:58.483 --> 32:00.880
Is this the way to see Phak, Uncle Inn?

359
32:18.900 --> 32:20.901
[MORGUE]

360
33:03.227 --> 33:04.228
Phak.

361
34:18.614 --> 34:19.615
Let’s go, Hattha.

362
34:28.214 --> 34:30.040
Notify me immediately once you obtain the arrest warrant.

363
34:30.256 --> 34:31.520
This is urgent. Do it as quickly as possible.

364
34:35.619 --> 34:38.400
Wait. I’m afraid neither of you can leave the country yet.

365
34:43.840 --> 34:46.160
I need both of you to come to the police station

366
34:46.331 --> 34:47.840
for questioning in connection with a murder case.

367
34:48.720 --> 34:52.321
Do you have an arrest warrant, Officer?

368
34:53.227 --> 34:55.800
At this stage, I only want to ask you a few questions.

369
34:56.534 --> 34:59.100
Then send an official written request to my office.

370
34:59.776 --> 35:01.360
My lawyer will notify me.

371
35:03.099 --> 35:04.100
Wait a moment.

372
35:04.379 --> 35:05.380
Please make way.

373
35:06.880 --> 35:07.881
I’ve checked.

374
35:08.176 --> 35:10.069
There is no order prohibiting them from leaving the country.

375
35:15.582 --> 35:16.800
What does that mean?

376
35:17.971 --> 35:18.972
We...

377
35:19.491 --> 35:20.720
We can’t arrest them, sweetheart.

378
35:27.115 --> 35:28.683
Police Colonel

379
35:29.766 --> 35:32.167
Krit Teeranasakul,

380
35:33.880 --> 35:34.881
I hope you’ll be happy.

381
35:37.411 --> 35:40.160
He killed my mother. He killed my family.

382
35:40.424 --> 35:42.040
Arrest him! Don’t let him go!

383
35:42.062 --> 35:45.120
He killed my mother! He killed my brother!

384
35:45.523 --> 35:48.880
- He killed my mom! - Hey, you can't accuse me like that.

385
35:49.288 --> 35:51.320
He killed my whole family.

386
35:52.072 --> 35:53.440
- Arrest him! - Go.

387
35:53.523 --> 35:55.000
Let me go!

388
35:55.731 --> 35:58.520
He killed my entire family!

389
35:59.496 --> 36:00.760
Let me go!

390
36:03.422 --> 36:05.640
Arrest him! Don’t let him get away!

391
36:08.016 --> 36:10.267
He killed my mother!

392
36:33.675 --> 36:34.676
Does that feel better?

393
36:35.668 --> 36:37.400
This is my dad’s shop. You can stop by sometime.

394
37:11.982 --> 37:12.983
Mom,

395
37:13.763 --> 37:14.764
Phak,

396
37:16.160 --> 37:17.480
let's move, okay?

397
37:27.080 --> 37:28.600
[ Ratchaburi ]

398
37:48.681 --> 37:49.682
Come on, sweetheart.

399
38:00.467 --> 38:03.480
What if Dad comes home and can’t find us, Uncle Inn?

400
38:15.019 --> 38:16.080
Minkheng.

401
38:20.600 --> 38:22.040
I have no one left.

402
38:23.168 --> 38:25.160
Yes, you do. You still have us.

403
38:46.795 --> 38:47.796
Dad?

404
39:15.102 --> 39:16.480
Help me, please!

405
39:26.595 --> 39:27.640
Bring the boat to shore!

406
39:28.739 --> 39:29.740
Hurry!

407
39:37.224 --> 39:38.640
Where are the owners of the house?

408
39:39.640 --> 39:40.641
That girl in red shirt.

409
39:52.536 --> 39:53.780
Uncle Korn is with me.

410
40:00.704 --> 40:03.800
Dad, are you hurt? I thought you had left me too.

411
40:05.998 --> 40:07.160
I’m all right, sweetheart.

412
40:11.000 --> 40:12.001
What about you?

413
40:13.001 --> 40:14.402
I’m okay.

414
40:20.558 --> 40:22.080
Your father refused to go to the hospital,

415
40:23.459 --> 40:25.310
so I treated him traditional way.

416
40:53.294 --> 40:54.295
I’m sorry.

417
41:09.456 --> 41:10.680
Dad, are you in pain?

418
41:15.302 --> 41:16.350
Your father was shot.

419
41:19.600 --> 41:20.901
The bullet struck his spine.

420
41:23.840 --> 41:26.641
He’s paralyzed now.

421
41:36.551 --> 41:40.400
It’s my fault. I couldn’t save your mother or your brother.

422
41:41.720 --> 41:44.606
No, Dad. It wasn’t your fault. It was theirs.

423
41:45.257 --> 41:48.040
Don’t cry, Dad. I’m still here with you.

424
41:49.651 --> 41:52.640
Don’t cry, Dad. I’m here with you.

425
41:54.918 --> 41:56.560
I’m still here, Dad.

426
42:16.904 --> 42:18.840
Are you sure it’s in here, Minkheng?

427
42:19.704 --> 42:22.480
If you mean the old herbal-compress recipes, your dad kept all of them in there.

428
42:22.779 --> 42:24.100
But what do you need them for?

429
42:24.731 --> 42:27.100
I’m going to use an herbal-compress recipe to treat Dad.

430
42:27.862 --> 42:29.867
If your father knew the recipe, surely he would remember it.

431
42:30.678 --> 42:31.720
Not necessarily.

432
42:32.064 --> 42:35.240
Dad is distressed about Mom and Phak. He may have forgotten it.

433
43:22.065 --> 43:23.166
[DO NOT READ]

434
43:35.982 --> 43:39.620
The point of death is known to all.

435
43:40.355 --> 43:44.100
But who knows the guiding point that hastens the fall?

436
43:44.750 --> 43:48.440
Who would press and hold the fatal point?

437
43:49.118 --> 43:53.120
Press the point beside it, and death shall claim them all.

438
44:09.886 --> 44:12.140
The Black Book says

439
44:12.392 --> 44:14.920
massage can be used to kill

440
44:15.435 --> 44:16.760
if the correct point is pressed.

441
44:17.328 --> 44:19.200
The fingers must be strong

442
44:19.563 --> 44:23.120
and powerful enough to apply pressure precisely

443
44:23.830 --> 44:25.200
to the intended target.

444
44:30.515 --> 44:33.116
Dad, can massage really kill someone?

445
44:35.094 --> 44:36.280
Why would you ask that, son?

446
44:37.463 --> 44:38.464
We heal people.

447
44:39.307 --> 44:40.440
We don't kill people.

448
44:44.544 --> 44:46.358
To strengthen your fingers,

449
44:46.523 --> 44:48.640
you must practice lifting the board every day

450
44:49.400 --> 44:51.050
while sitting in the full lotus position.

451
44:51.800 --> 44:52.920
28…

452
44:53.376 --> 44:55.840
29…30…

453
44:57.022 --> 44:58.840
Cup your hands,

454
44:59.016 --> 45:01.120
then lift your body off the ground.

455
45:02.019 --> 45:03.040
11…

456
45:04.496 --> 45:05.760
12…

457
45:07.960 --> 45:09.360
Practice every day

458
45:09.998 --> 45:11.760
until your thumbs are strong enough

459
45:12.526 --> 45:14.360
to press the Sen lines with perfect precision.

460
46:14.259 --> 46:15.260
37…

461
46:15.920 --> 46:16.921
38…

462
46:17.760 --> 46:18.761
39…

463
46:19.920 --> 46:20.921
40…

464
46:21.819 --> 46:22.820
41…

465
46:23.560 --> 46:24.561
42…

466
46:25.350 --> 46:26.351
43…

467
46:27.320 --> 46:28.321
44…

468
46:29.715 --> 46:30.716
45…

469
46:33.800 --> 46:36.960
Today marks the auspicious official launch

470
46:37.001 --> 46:38.904
of the Arokaya Land project.

471
46:39.075 --> 46:42.320
It is a new, fully integrated wellness center.

472
46:42.440 --> 46:44.760
Dongyang, a Chinese businessman,

473
46:44.872 --> 46:47.920
has invested an enormous sum in this project.

474
46:48.400 --> 46:50.560
Moreover, we are joined by Master Tim,

475
46:50.601 --> 46:53.202
who is regarded as a grand master of traditional Thai massage

476
46:53.250 --> 46:56.400
and is highly renowned both in Thailand and abroad.

477
46:56.451 --> 46:58.640
He has also just completed his latest mission:

478
46:58.650 --> 47:02.760
a global tour providing therapeutic massage around the world.

479
47:02.824 --> 47:04.720
Master Tim, may I ask

480
47:04.750 --> 47:07.320
what made you decide to join Arokaya Land?

481
47:07.720 --> 47:10.521
I want to preserve Thai wisdom for future generations.

482
47:11.100 --> 47:12.800
It is my way of giving back to my homeland

483
47:13.907 --> 47:15.400
so this knowledge can continue to be passed down.

484
47:15.726 --> 47:18.814
Master Tim, there are rumors that Arokaya Land has a hidden agenda

485
47:18.877 --> 47:20.400
and may be connected to a casino.

486
47:20.472 --> 47:23.240
Some say it will tarnish traditional Thai massage by using soft power as a front.

487
47:23.320 --> 47:24.520
What are your thoughts on these allegations?

488
47:25.261 --> 47:29.440
Even a tree will flourish if you fertilize it with manure.

489
47:30.976 --> 47:33.400
Hey, I’m only joking. I was trying to paint a picture.

490
47:33.659 --> 47:36.336
My sole intention is

491
47:36.582 --> 47:39.600
to support our massage therapists

492
47:39.741 --> 47:41.920
and help their profession reach every corner of the world.

493
47:42.619 --> 47:46.820
And don’t forget, we’re recruiting a new generation of massage therapists

494
47:48.000 --> 47:49.920
to join Arokaya Land.

495
47:50.256 --> 47:52.350
See? We’re giving the profession our full support.

496
47:52.360 --> 47:55.000
So, if anyone wants to become a massage therapist under my guidance,

497
47:55.574 --> 47:56.640
you’re welcome to apply.

498
47:59.331 --> 48:00.800
- We should apply. - Let's go.

499
48:02.659 --> 48:03.660
What a shame.

500
48:04.910 --> 48:06.240
The whole country respects him,

501
48:07.091 --> 48:08.192
yet he serves an evil man.

502
48:09.300 --> 48:11.848
Dongyang has invested far too much in this project.

503
48:12.344 --> 48:13.571
There’s no way it’s just a wellness center.

504
48:14.211 --> 48:15.587
They’re definitely hiding a casino inside.

505
48:17.600 --> 48:19.601
Maybe he’ll only stop committing evil once he’s dead.

506
48:20.800 --> 48:21.801
Hey!

507
48:22.350 --> 48:24.651
You’re still thinking about that? You’ll end up in prison.

508
48:25.560 --> 48:26.915
What about when he killed the people we loved?

509
48:27.891 --> 48:28.892
He never went to prison.

510
48:30.259 --> 48:32.360
Then how are we supposed to kill him without going to prison, kiddo?

511
48:38.110 --> 48:39.600
All right, I have to go.

512
48:39.603 --> 48:41.400
- Okay? - Wait.

513
48:41.420 --> 48:43.600
How many massage therapists are you recruiting, Master Tim?

514
48:56.547 --> 48:59.480
The ankle is dislocated and twisted out of shape.

515
49:02.392 --> 49:04.520
- Muk, call the ambulance. - Got it.

516
49:37.272 --> 49:38.320
Take him to the hospital.

517
49:38.720 --> 49:39.721
Okay, sir.

518
49:39.795 --> 49:41.440
Have a conventional doctor examine him again.

519
49:42.435 --> 49:44.360
Thank you, Master. Thank you.

520
49:45.011 --> 49:47.680
That was incredible. He's truly amazing.

521
49:47.720 --> 49:50.920
See? He’s so skilled that people are willing to pay hundreds of thousands.

522
49:51.187 --> 49:53.920
Look, it was twisted out of shape just moments ago, and he fixed it right away.

523
49:54.120 --> 49:55.760
- How could he do that? - Look!

524
50:13.160 --> 50:14.161
[FLATFOOT ?]

525
50:20.600 --> 50:22.087
[DONGYANG JOINS FLOOD-RELIEF EFFORTS]

526
50:22.840 --> 50:24.000
[SCHOLARSHIP CEREMONY FOR THE FUTURE OF OUR YOUTH]

527
50:26.000 --> 50:27.001
[INEXPERIENCED NOVICE ENGINEER]

528
50:36.200 --> 50:37.201
[FLATFOOT ?]

529
50:43.846 --> 50:46.896
The deadly art of massage is not a method of healing.

530
50:47.995 --> 50:50.120
It uses knowledge of the body’s tendons,

531
50:50.720 --> 50:52.440
blood, vital energy,

532
50:52.920 --> 50:54.440
and pulse points

533
50:55.046 --> 50:57.000
to transform touch into a weapon

534
50:57.447 --> 51:01.240
that stops a person’s breath without leaving a wound.

535
51:06.800 --> 51:09.160
Ittha, Pingkhala,

536
51:09.595 --> 51:12.080
Sumana, Kalathari,

537
51:12.920 --> 51:15.160
Sahatsarangsi,

538
51:15.730 --> 51:18.320
Thawari, Chanthaphusang,

539
51:19.000 --> 51:21.120
Rucham, Sukhumang, and

540
51:21.688 --> 51:22.760
Sikhini.

541
51:34.710 --> 51:37.574
The client requested a young female therapist with a firm touch.

542
51:38.357 --> 51:41.029
So it’ll have to be you, Hattha.

543
51:42.102 --> 51:43.103
Leave it to me.

544
51:43.355 --> 51:44.356
I’m counting on you.

545
51:47.800 --> 51:48.840
May I?

546
52:43.990 --> 52:44.991
Hey!

547
52:46.678 --> 52:47.679
What the hell?

548
53:21.198 --> 53:22.199
Mom!

549
53:32.115 --> 53:34.520
Burn him alive. Let him guard this damn shop.

550
54:41.027 --> 54:42.050
May I?

551
54:56.912 --> 54:58.320
Sis!

552
54:59.104 --> 55:01.440
Where did that Chinese client upstairs go?

553
55:01.494 --> 55:04.480
Where have you been? I had to take over the massage for you.

554
55:05.115 --> 55:07.880
He had some business to attend to and left before the massage was finished.

555
55:08.502 --> 55:09.760
- He's gone? - Yeah.

556
55:12.758 --> 55:13.759
What's the matter?

557
55:54.630 --> 55:55.631
Shit!

558
56:35.184 --> 56:36.185
Hey!

559
56:37.552 --> 56:39.067
Panic? Are you having a panic attack?

560
56:40.560 --> 56:42.480
Calm down. Calm down.

561
56:44.261 --> 56:45.880
It’s okay. Just stay calm.

562
56:45.990 --> 56:47.840
Look at me. Look at me.

563
56:49.200 --> 56:50.201
Breathe in.

564
56:50.600 --> 56:51.601
Breathe out.

565
56:51.800 --> 56:52.801
Take deep breaths.

566
56:53.190 --> 56:54.191
In.

567
56:54.560 --> 56:55.561
Out.

568
56:56.246 --> 56:57.247
In.

569
56:57.798 --> 56:58.799
Out.

570
57:02.496 --> 57:03.497
Just stay calm, okay?

571
57:13.710 --> 57:14.711
Are you okay?

572
57:39.286 --> 57:42.440
Arokaya Land is holding auditions for massage therapists tomorrow.

573
57:43.614 --> 57:45.280
Dongyang and his men are not to be underestimated.

574
57:45.300 --> 57:47.520
If we want to get close to him, we’ll have to do it through massage, right?

575
57:47.840 --> 57:49.400
Your muscles are stiff and tense.

576
57:49.860 --> 57:50.976
It’s as if you’re carrying a heavy burden.

577
57:51.061 --> 57:52.240
May I take the practical test again?

578
57:58.027 --> 57:59.028
What are you doing?

579
57:59.334 --> 58:00.335
Let me help you for a change.
